      "jp": "ナルケパフネさんにミルクを運んでから数日後。\n僕は彼女と一緒に島を散歩していた。",
      "jp_sha256": "248a226d842d3f7563c695e533e0f72fca113ac66ad972e3e7f1a7256ed57935",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "나르케파프네 씨에게 우유를 옮겨 준 지 며칠 뒤.\n나는 그녀와 함께 섬을 산책하고 있었다.",
      "message_index_0based": 0,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 15,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "ce477c553dd061018d36e7d134b50e9ed623e36fcafb6a3286733d58557a8ca2:000000_-7418001725750714205:g0:r14",
      "row_index_0based": 14,
      "serialized_row_index": 14,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ナルケパフネさんにミルクを運んでから数日後。\n僕は彼女と一緒に島を散歩していた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "3ba0e5e0a599f841384ac32fec2d7d10ba5402ec66d721219dcb4ec97b100f07",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "お誘いに応じてくれてありがとう、ご主人さま。\n頑張ってくれたお礼ということで、\n今日は私の『とっておきの場所』に案内するね。",
      "jp_sha256": "489b114650d94c7ce13671fca7a561656b369e94819b12dbbe5fe31700008078",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "초대에 응해 줘서 고마워, 주인님.\n애써 준 것에 대한 답례로\n오늘은 내 ‘비장의 장소’에 안내할게.",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 16,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "ce477c553dd061018d36e7d134b50e9ed623e36fcafb6a3286733d58557a8ca2:000000_-7418001725750714205:g0:r15",
      "row_index_0based": 15,
      "serialized_row_index": 15,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "ナルケパフネ",
        "Emt4_Enj",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "お誘いに応じてくれてありがとう、ご主人さま。\n頑張ってくれたお礼ということで、\n今日は私の『とっておきの場所』に案内するね。",
        "",
        "ch_10079/R18/10079B0_10079_Nml/10079B0_10079_001",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "ナルケパフネ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": "ch_10079/R18/10079B0_10079_Nml/10079B0_10079_001"
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "a85d06fa07f54d6d3038563972f4eb9d20bfb9273367652276b367f02fc48f8a",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "あれくらい、お礼をされることじゃありませんよ。\nでもナルケパフネさんに誘ってもらえたのは嬉しいです。\nいったい、どんなところに連れて行ってくれるんですか？",
      "jp_sha256": "c6145ee593dbf66af68335aa6006da2a740217c5658ecdb164abb7ada8690071",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그 정도는 답례받을 일이 아니에요.\n하지만 나르케파프네 씨가 초대해 줘서 기뻐요.\n대체 어떤 곳에 데려가 주실 건가요?",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 17,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "ce477c553dd061018d36e7d134b50e9ed623e36fcafb6a3286733d58557a8ca2:000000_-7418001725750714205:g0:r16",
      "row_index_0based": 16,
      "serialized_row_index": 16,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "あれくらい、お礼をされることじゃありませんよ。\nでもナルケパフネさんに誘ってもらえたのは嬉しいです。\nいったい、どんなところに連れて行ってくれるんですか？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "e1d1e13251f077bc38cc8e7bb75d7608383115943b7458225755a47414eefb16",
